<title>UK: CCCEP sets 800 million French franc 11-year bond. [CORRECTED 14:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>CCCEP sets 800 million French franc 11-year bond. [CORRECTED 14:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Caisse des Depots et Consignations.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CCCEP</p>
<p> AMT    800 MLN FRF   COUPON    *5.56	MATURITY    25.JUL.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.30    PAY DATE    25.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.70	REOFFER    100.0     SPREAD	+27 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA+	 DENOMS (K) FIVE	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND EIGHT-YEAR OAT</p>
<p> NOTES     *TO 25.JUL.05 (corrects from 25.JUL.09) THEN IF NOT CALLED 		AT PAR STEPS-UP TO 7.33 PCT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
